`,d.jsx(t.p,{children:"When I started running campaigns for the Dalhousie Science Society, I noticed that the events with the highest attendance were not the ones we promoted most aggressively. They were the ones that fit into existing student routines. A Thursday event after class, with food, promoted through channels students already checked daily."}),`
